// 011.15 (D36, #41): `Scenario b After a`, `Let alias = expr.`, and singleton `Role` elision.
Role borrower Is Elena
Role lender Is Marcus
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Var balance Identified by usd
Act lend Actor lender Recipient borrower Related to usd Holds when True Creates balance(usd)
Act repay Actor borrower Recipient lender Related to usd
  Holds when usd <= balance
  Creates balance(balance - usd)
.
Scenario loan-opened {
  lend(1000).
  ?(balance == 1000).
}

Scenario half-repaid After loan-opened {
  Let Half = repay(Elena, Marcus, 400).
  ?lawful Half.
  Half.
  ?(balance == 600).
  repay(600).
  ?(balance == 0).
}
